+# batch 3 measured 27 GiB RSS per rank at 4B), GPUs >= 40 GB (4B peaked 11-12 GiB per GPU, 12B ~28 GiB).
+# Priorities 53-59: below every batch-3 job (60-75), so batch 4 queues behind what is already submitted.
